t $116.14, its first close above the base high of $113.22. Volume that day was 408K shares, 1.05x the prior 10-day average of 389K. It didn't hold. By Feb 24, 2025 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $151.11.","lesson":"This is an example of a shakeout. The breakout failed by the rules, closing below the level three days running, and then the stock recovered and ran. Cutting it was still the right call when it happened. A failed breakout that fixes itself is worth watching for a re-entry, not a reason to ignore the exit."}}